f02f2749619543e403be800d","position":"1788920242954381001-b934fa8c-4cb4-4fcf-9a79-e2707957853d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Created from REB closeout failures. Existing prior bug ferric-jet-scorpion fixed own-or-descendant commit crediting, but ibex/goitered/wrasse still fail the deterministic close precheck after AC completion and child closeout; beginning RCA.","timestamp":1788895139377337001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RCA complete. Repro: ibex/goitered/wrasse each have complete ACs and all children closed, but close precheck fails before verifier with 'no commit references it (nor any of its descendants)'. Code path: close_precheck._completion_precheck -> _resolved_completion_scope -> _check_work_landed -> _referencing_commits. Prior fix ferric-jet-scorpion correctly unions the parent and transitive descendants, but these closeout epics' implementation children were administrative duplicate shells: each closed child records the work as living on a replacement ticket outside the parent subtree. The accepted-id set omitted those live replacement tickets, so referencing_commits scanned only duplicate shells and found zero, while the real landed commits reference the replacements. Verdict: genuine deterministic precheck defect, not intended policy. The gate should credit closed disposition replacements (and their subtree) as evidence while still failing when no referenced/attached commit exists anywhere in that expanded evidence set.","timestamp":1788897997884920001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implementation milestone: RED regression test_parent_close_credits_duplicate_child_replacement_commit reproduced the parent close precheck failure when the only landed commit referenced a duplicate child's live replacement. Fix expands completion evidence scope from closed disposition tickets to their live replacements and descendants, without dropping the existing no-reference fail-closed protection. Targeted validation is green: pytest close subtree + completion gate + duration instrumentation (49 passed) and ruff check on changed files passed. File impact updated to actual changed paths.","timestamp":1788898199221309001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Full local verification passed after rebasing onto origin/main: env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT ... PATH=\"/Users/joeoakhart/close-scan/.venv/bin:/Applications/ChatGPT.app/Contents/Resources:/opt/homebrew/opt/node@22/bin:/opt/homebrew/opt/python@3.14/libexec/bin:/Applications/Visual\\ Studio\\ Code.app/Contents/Resources/app/bin:/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@17/bin:/usr/local/opt/postgresql@17/bin:/Users/joeoakhart/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/opt/homebrew/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/System/Cryptexes/App/usr/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin:/var/run/com.apple.security.cryptexd/codex.system/bootstrap/usr/local/bin:/var/run/com.apple.security.cryptexd/codex.system/bootstrap/usr/bin:/var/run/com.apple.security.cryptexd/codex.system/bootstrap/usr/appleinternal/bin:/pkg/env/global/bin:/opt/homebrew/opt/ruby@3.4/bin:/opt/homebrew/lib/ruby/gems/3.4.0/bin:/Users/joeoakhart/.lmstudio/bin\" make verify exited 0 (lint, typecheck, and the non-integration/non-external pytest gate).","timestamp":1788903616531531001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed fix for review: Gerrit change 2853 (Credit duplicate close replacements). Waiting for LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before submit.","timestamp":1788903639213773001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Addressed LLM-Review advisory findings before submit: pinned replacement lookup now fail-closes on unreadable pinned states, iterates past non-live duplicate targets to match replacement_of(require_live=True), and treats pinned states with an error field as non-live. Targeted close-gate suite remains green (49 passed); full make verify rerun passed after these changes.","timestamp":1788908635448763001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Uploaded patch set 2 on Gerrit 2853 with advisory fixes; prior votes correctly reset. Waiting for renewed LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1788909030106113001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Addressed patch set 2 LLM-Review block: expansion is now explicitly limited to DISPOSITION_CLASSES, the materialized path delegates to find_replacement, and regression tests cover duplicate success, superseded success, no-commit fail-closed, and non-disposition bug close not crediting a replacement. Targeted failures from full verify were unrelated git-commit timeout under load and passed when rerun directly (3 passed).","timestamp":1788914417809134001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Addressed patch set 3 LLM-Review block: added regression coverage for replacement descendant commits, chained replacement dispositions, superseded signatures, and fail-closed behavior when replacement evidence is absent/non-disposition. Also changed FIFO expansion from list pop(0) to deque. Targeted close-gate suite is green: 55 passed.","timestamp":1788916640544457001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Addressed patch set 4 LLM-Review block: added pinned-view positive and archived-replacement negative tests so the ticket_view evidence path is covered for both crediting and fail-closed liveness. Targeted close-gate suite now green: 57 passed.","timestamp":1788917629507929001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit 2853 reached LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 on patch set 5, then submitted successfully. Merged as 7ffd53d92ab8d. Proceeding to validate by closing the three blocked REB epics.","timestamp":1788920242954381001}],"created_at":1788895094276895001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6cca2083-2fe8-4501-a47a-f8feb8a104db","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"95da-0b4f-06a8-4b9c"},{"link_uuid":"afd4a089-e468-48f1-90a2-efa11cf76e59","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c1a8-9a29-0665-4e2d"},{"link_uuid":"26116e3d-796d-4a39-924e-081662d44ecf","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c14f-cdef-4d61-44b3"},{"link_uuid":"49f81fc3-2279-41f6-80b3-a57110fcc88b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d35d-7213-92d4-45aa"},{"link_uuid":"6c9245f6-6dff-46ee-8d26-cc31cdcf660e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"151c-b369-d2fb-49d2"},{"link_uuid":"ea7590dd-538e-4209-8adc-1693efead87a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"11f7-24d4-d2fa-4b20"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThree REB epic closeouts are blocked after all acceptance criteria were marked complete and their open children were closed:\n\n- `nauseating-inquiring-ibex` / `95da-0b4f-06a8-4b9c`\n- `subjective-sudden-goitered` / `df55-1305-956e-431b`\n- `decorous-plucky-wrasse` / `e867-0f39-b887-40fa`\n\nEach close fails before the completion verifier with:\n\n```text\nError: cannot close <epic>: it records file_impact (a code change) but no commit references it (nor any of its descendants). Add a 'rebar-ticket: <id>' trailer to the commit that implements it, then retry (or override with --force=\"<reason>\"). Completion verification cannot confirm the work landed without a referencing commit.\n```\n\nPrior bug `ferric-jet-scorpion` (`1edf-2261-a092-43e5`) fixed the simpler case where a parent should credit commits from its transitive descendants. This bug tracks the remaining closeout failure: coordination/rollup epics may be proven by closed children, administrative duplicate/obsolete dispositions, and replacement tickets, yet the deterministic precheck still prevents a non-force close.\n\n## RCA Plan\n\n1. Reproduce using the three blocked epics above and capture the full close-precheck error.\n2. Locate the deterministic completion precheck and referencing-commit scan in `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` and its tests.\n3. Trace the accepted-id set built for an epic: own id, transitive descendants, and any replacement/superseding tickets recorded by administrative close dispositions.\n4. Determine whether the failure is a defect or intended policy. If it is intended behavior requiring policy change, stop and escalate. If it is a defect, fix only the missing evidence path while preserving the fail-closed protection for code tickets with no landed/referenced work.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The bug is classified with RCA as either a genuine defect or intended policy; the ticket records the exact code path and evidence.\n- [ ] If defect, a RED test reproduces a blocked epic close where closed child/replacement evidence should satisfy the deterministic landed-work precheck.\n- [ ] The fix preserves the current protection: a code-impact ticket with no referencing commit in its accepted evidence set still fails with `cannot confirm the work landed`.\n- [ ] The three known blocked epics (`ibex`, `goitered`, `wrasse`) can close without `--force` after the fix lands, or the ticket records why a policy decision is required instead.\n- [ ] Targeted tests and `make verify` pass before Gerrit upload.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py","reason":"Expands completion close evidence scope before landed-work/reference checks."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_scope.py","reason":"Adds narrow helper for closed disposition replacement evidence expansion."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_gate_subtree.py","reason":"Regression coverage for parent closes crediting duplicate replacement commits."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","11f7-24d4-d2fa-4b20"],["relates_to","151c-b369-d2fb-49d2"],["relates_to","c14f-cdef-4d61-44b3"],["relates_to","c1a8-9a29-0665-4e2d"],["relates_to","d35d-7213-92d4-45aa"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"2bf903b1-2ac7-49a7-85ed-4d5c9a916f56","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9181-7c2e-5718-4f7f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Completion close precheck still misses implemented descendant/replacement evidence for epic closeouts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["262a080c-08b1-4873-8c12-c93635846b3c","350720b7-b39b-4d2b-9df1-413f97753890","e2dcde4d-36d2-4c35-8892-241fc3624549","afd4a089-e468-48f1-90a2-efa11cf76e59","39cf3141-8ab4-41a4-a565-7ccaf0791088","c215a7ad-e9c9-4835-aa5d-4c1e3364aaf4","26116e3d-796d-4a39-924e-081662d44ecf","7457cf57-b9d5-49b8-bbd2-1299a93c28fe","49f81fc3-2279-41f6-80b3-a57110fcc88b","d0056614-44ff-42e7-bc30-49718db45b49","6c9245f6-6dff-46ee-8d26-cc31cdcf660e","c02e4d9b-80b5-48ec-a58e-3cff13806e1c","ea7590dd-538e-4209-8adc-1693efead87a","b934fa8c-4cb4-4fcf-9a79-e2707957853d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","t